339
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,568
¿Qué es eso?

340
00:20:37,069 --> 00:20:38,237
Solo un anestésico.

341
00:20:41,573 --> 00:20:43,283
No queremos

342
00:20:41,573 --> 00:20:43,283
que te interpongas otra vez.

343
00:20:58,590 --> 00:21:00,259
Cuenta conmigo, Isaac.

344
00:21:01,718 --> 00:21:04,429
Uno. Dos.

345
00:21:05,931 --> 00:21:07,015
Tres.

346
00:21:16,108 --> 00:21:17,401
¿PODEMOS HABLAR?

347
00:21:29,621 --> 00:21:30,998
¿Sr. McCall?

348
00:21:37,963 --> 00:21:41,425
Seguro es una emergencia

349
00:21:37,963 --> 00:21:41,425
